  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Beach Fun Carriage House – Sleeps 4 | Walk to the Beach | Quiet 30A Getaway<br>Tucked away in a peaceful neighborhood just off iconic 30A, Beach Fun Carriage House is the perfect coastal retreat for small families or couples looking to relax, explore, and enjoy the best of Dune Allen Beach. With the sugar‑white sand only a short walk away, this charming two‑story carriage house blends comfort, convenience, and that unmistakable 30A vibe.<br>Cozy Coastal Living<br>Step inside to a bright and welcoming main level featuring the living area, full bathroom, and easy access to the outdoors. Upstairs, an open loft bunk space offers a fun hideaway for kids or extra guests, while the king master suite provides a spacious retreat complete with a large walk‑in closet. Laundry is conveniently located on the second floor.<br>Room for Everyone<br>The home sleeps up to 4 guests comfortably and includes parking for 2 vehicles—a rare perk along 30A. The quiet neighborhood setting makes it easy to unwind after a day in the sun.<br>Walk or Bike to Everything<br>From this location, you’re moments from the best of 30A:<br>• \tDune Allen Beach – a short stroll to the emerald water and soft white sand<br>• \tTopsail Hill Preserve State Park – stunning dunes, nature trails, and untouched coastline<br>• \tTimpoochee Bike Trail – 19 - miles of scenic riding connecting all of 30A’s beach towns<br>• \tStinky’s Fish Camp – a beloved local favorite for fresh seafood and live music<br>• \tNearby dining, coffee shops, boutiques, and coastal markets<br>Whether you’re here for beach days, bike rides, or exploring the natural beauty of South Walton, Beach Fun Carriage House offers the perfect home base.<br>Your 30A Escape Awaits<br>Relax, recharge, and enjoy the simple pleasures of coastal living. Beach Fun Carriage House brings together comfort, location, and the laid‑back charm that makes 30A unforgettable.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Beach Fun Carriage House"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
